            <ArticleTitle>Compact focusing grating couplers for silicon horizontal slot waveguides.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>490-493</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1364/OL.42.000490</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this Letter, we present the design, simulation (2D and 3D), fabrication, and experimental characterization of compact and fully etched focusing gratings for a horizontal slot waveguide based on a silicon nitride layer sandwiched between amorphous silicon and a silicon-on-insulator. The measured coupling losses are about 4 dB with a 3 dB bandwidth of 38 nm. The fully etched configuration allows the fabrication in a single lithography step.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
